## Database Backup

The scraper includes backup and restore scripts:

```bash
cd lament-scrapper

# Create backup
bun run backup

# Restore from backup
bun run restore
```

Backups are stored as JSON files in the project directory.

## R2 Storage

Cloudflare R2 data can be backed up using the AWS CLI (S3-compatible):

```bash
aws s3 sync s3://your-bucket ./backup \
  --endpoint-url https://ACCOUNT_ID.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
```

## Reconciliation

To ensure database and R2 storage are in sync:

```bash
cd lament-scrapper
bun run reconcile
```

This checks for orphaned records and missing files.
